\newlabel{tab:panels}{{1}{5}{Observed final graphs and integer flip costs. Degree counts comparisons incident on a participant, whereas edges count distinct participant pairs. Nominal fractions use all usable rows, including uneditable ties. Equal percentages do not imply equal absolute intervention size or information content}{table.caption.4}{}}
